  "description": "The Horizon SUV 10 is a fully equipped e-trekking bike built for comfortable, confident everyday riding. Bright LED lights improve visibility, and the Racktime rear carrier with KID'n'CARRY and SNAPIT 2.0 compatibility makes it easy to bring accessories or a child seat – plus it's trailer-compatible for extra cargo.\n\nAn adjustable stem helps you find a comfortable riding position, SP Connect allows secure smartphone attachment, and the dropper seat post enables quick height adjustment for easy mounting and stopping.\n\nWide trekking tires add grip and cushioning on uneven trails and gravel paths, while full fenders keep you protected in all weather. With 120mm front suspension and a smooth-shifting 11-speed drivetrain, it's ready for longer touring days as well as daily routes.\n\nPowered by the Bosch Performance Line CX motor and a removable 800Wh PowerTube battery, it supports extended rides with ease. The bike is also compatible with the Bosch PowerMore range extender. The Bosch eBike Flow App offers ride data, connectivity tools and upgrade options.",
